  "formGlyphsComment": "v3 fantasy night (Aug 2026 notes): lantern (big, windowed, Hermit's) alone in cell 1; clouds spread + sailing, moon = deep crescent 2x wide; rook watches the opening moon in cells 4-5 and the closing moon in cell 28. Scenes: wisps 2:00-3:36 (Traum der Liebe), heptagram shooting star 3:12 (lacht), briar 3:36-4:48 (fast growth) with a small rose at the top of cell 12, sleeping eye PAIRS 4:48-6:00 (each pair blinks together; once per loop a pair wakes = Schlimmes), rune inscription 6:00-8:00 set as TYPE on one baseline, letters carving in one at a time and holding (unbroken common-tone chain; neutral letters only: fehu uruz raido kenaz gebo wunjo). Threads (common tones) now ghost-faint (~0.1) and morph flat-sine-triangle-square-pulse. tilt on thread = line y (C#=85 D=78 D#=71 E=64 F#=50 G=43 A=29 B=15). Pictorial textures aspect-compensate via measured patch aspect (unsquish)."
